reserveAssets.t.sol
├── when caller does not have the {PERPEX_ROLE}
│   └── it should revert with {AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount} error
└── when caller has {PERPEX_ROLE}
    ├── when assets is zero
    │   └── it should revert with {POOL__INVALID_RESERVE_AMOUNT} error
    └── when assets is not zero
        ├── when reserving would exceed max utilization
        │   └── it should revert with {POOL__MAX_UTILIZATION_EXCEEDED} error
        └── when reserving would not exceed max utilization
            ├── it should increase the reserved assets
            └── it should emit the {AssetsReserved} event
